  "description": {
    "text": "Champion's League 2006 was held on 17 September 2006 at the Taiwan PokéPark, the first held outside Japan, for the 2005 Elite Four and the first-place winners of Battle Road Summer 2006. Players played four Swiss rounds in the morning and four in the afternoon, under different deck rules, and the top four of each division on their combined score became the new Elite Four. They won the same Champion's League card as in 2005, in a new trophy shield.",
